except now there's no Billy
or Randy or Tatum.

529
00:30:36,401 --> 00:30:38,033
Speaking of whom, your daughter,

530
00:30:38,161 --> 00:30:40,753
her name's Tatum.
That is so adorable.

531
00:30:40,880 --> 00:30:45,553
I mean, It's a little weird or
whatever, but it's supercute.

532
00:30:45,680 --> 00:30:47,761
And she is

533
