Do not talk about my daughter.

535
00:30:52,913 --> 00:30:54,224
Oh. Okay, yeah.

536
00:30:54,353 --> 00:30:55,985
I should definitely
tell you, though,

537
00:30:56,113 --> 00:30:59,185
