Not when I was there.
Wait, you were here?

605
00:35:56,433 --> 00:35:57,680
No, he left and I was there.

606
00:35:57,810 --> 00:36:00,113
But I didn't see you.

607
00:36:00,242 --> 00:36:02,193
I was in the dressing rooms.

608
