Tatum.

680
00:40:00,625 --> 00:40:01,937
Stay behind me.

681
00:40:08,049 --> 00:40:09,233
Tatum.

682
00:40:11,313 --> 00:40:12,305
Tatum.

683
00:40:19,025 --> 00:40:20,177
Dad.

684
00:40:23,281 --> 00:40:25,489
Please, leave her alone.

685
00:40:28,945 --> 00:40:30,481
Mark, put the gun down.

686
00:40:37,297 --> 00:40:39,698
Hon, it's gonna be okay.

687
00:40:39,825 --> 00:40:40,945
Just look at me.

688
