Yeah.

698
00:41:52,753 --> 00:41:54,057
What is that?
It's another way out.

699
00:41:54,097 --> 00:41:55,633
I need to get your dad.
You stay here.

700
00:41:55,761 --> 00:41:57,137
No, you can't leave me, Mom!

701
00:41:59,281 --> 00:42:00,689
Let me go with you, please!

702
00:42:00,817 --> 00:42:02,385
Okay, hurry.

703
00:42:13,297 --> 00:42:14,642
Down to the end. Go.

704
00:42:14,769 --> 00:42:15,953
Okay.

705
00:42:24,144 --> 00:42:25,553
Shh.

706
00:42:47,121 --> 00:42:48,849
Mom!
This way!

707
00:42:51,280 --> 00:42:52,721
Mom!
Go, go, go!

708
00:43:03,152 --> 00:43:04,145
Okay.

709
00:43:12,178 --> 00:43:13,393
Shh...

710
00:43:20,176 --> 00:43:21,233
Go, go, go!

711
00:43:29,361 --> 00:43:30,833
Mom!

712
00:43:31,696 --> 00:43:32,849
Go!

713
00:43:51,698 --> 00:43:53,680
Okay. This way.

714
00:44:14,800 --> 00:44:16,016
Get the police! Go!
Mom!

715
00:44:16,145 --> 00:44:18,769
Help! Somebody help us!

716
