Hey, are you okay?

717
00:44:43,696 --> 00:44:45,681
Are you okay?
Yeah.

718
00:44:45,809 --> 00:44:47,633
God, I love you.
I love you.

719
00:44:52,848 --> 00:44:53,969
Did I get him?

720
00:44:54,353 --> 00:44:55,312
You got him!

721
00:44:55,376 --> 00:44:56,945
Chad, get the camera now.

722
00:44:57,073 --> 00:44:58,289
Mindy, set up for a remote.

723
00:44:58,417 --> 00:45:00,066
Ma'am, you need to stay
inside your vehicle.

724
00:45:00,113 --> 00:45:01,969
