725
00:45:02,385 --> 00:45:03,953
Mom! Dad!

726
00:45:06,514 --> 00:45:07,952
Are you okay?
I'm okay.

727
00:45:08,081 --> 00:45:10,097
Oh, that was horrifying.
That was awesome.

728
00:45:10,225 --> 00:45:12,178
Grab the camera.
We need B-roll of everything.

729
