Karl Allen Gibbs.

757
00:46:47,089 --> 00:46:49,360
He escaped from Fallbrook
Psychiatric Hospital
two weeks ago.

758
00:46:49,489 --> 00:46:50,769
Triple murderer.

759
00:46:50,898 --> 00:46:54,034
Any idea why he'd come after
you or your family?

760
00:46:54,160 --> 00:46:56,305
No.
Thanks, Cooke.

761
00:46:56,882 --> 00:46:58,129
Chief.

762
00:47:04,402 --> 00:47:05,554
Well...

763
00:47:05,680 --> 00:47:07,121
He's not gonna hurt anyone else.

764
00:47:07,249 --> 00:47:08,816
No.

765
00:47:09,809 --> 00:47:11,185
This was too easy.

766
00:47:12,593 --> 00:47:13,776
