rip both your throats out.

785
00:48:06,898 --> 00:48:07,889
Got it?
Copy that.

786
00:48:08,018 --> 00:48:09,778
We just learned
that Gale Weathers

787
00:48:09,905 --> 00:48:12,944
from the now defunct talk show
Good Morning with
Gale Weathers is in town.

788
00:48:13,073 --> 00:48:14,192
